      "value": "axial rigidity, spasms and the typical hyperlordosis of the lumbar spine, in conjunction with the neurophysiological findings of continuous motor unit activity and enhanced exteroceptive reflexes. Anti-GAD antibodies were strongly positive and other organ specific autoantibodies were present",
      "quote": "We made a diagnosis of SMS on the basis of the axial rigidity, spasms and the typical hyperlordosis of the lumbar spine, in conjunction with the neurophysiological findings of continuous motor unit activity and enhanced exteroceptive reflexes. Anti-GAD antibodies were strongly positive and other organ specific autoantibodies were present supporting the diagnosis of SMS.",
