    {
      "field_name": "diagnostic_basis_emg",
      "value": "used",
      "quote": "EMG showed continuous motor unit activity in the axial musculature, and exteroceptive reflexes, elicited from the posterior tibial nerve at the ankle, were abnormally pronounced.",
